Run.Description Constant-energy ARPES map of graphene at E = -1.2 eV over the first BZ
Run.Prefix generate

Run.TypeOfSystem Graphene
TB.Hopping 3.1

Structure.LatticeParameter 2.46000
Structure.CellSize 1
Structure.SuperCell 1

Calculate.OnlyDOS .false.
Kubo.Calc .false.
Diag.Calc .true.

Calculate.SpectralEnergyCut .true.
Spectral.WeiKu .true.

Diag.KGrid 181 181 1
Spectral.KGridCut 1.8
Spectral.UseCoordinates .true.
&begin Spectral.Path 1
0.0 0.0 0.0   # Gamma
&end Spectral.Path

Kubo.NumberofEnergyPoints 2
Spectral.Emin 0-1.2/3.1
Spectral.Emax 0-1.2/3.1+0.24
Kubo.Epsilon 0.02
Spectral.energyGridResolution 0.2

TB.NeighLevels 1
Neigh.CompareAll .true.
Stack.NonBulkSmall .true.

Output.WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
